ommit since round 1 is HEAD (abc1234). Do NOT edit files, commit, push, comment on the PR, or watch it. Read-only.\n\n## Your round 1 findings\n1. P1: Stop does nothing when the task row is already cancelled but the client still shows it running.\n2. P2: The new helper writes the parent node twice.\n\n## Author response\nBoth fixed in abc1234.\n\nReport: VERDICT (ship or fix first), whether each round 1 finding is fixed, and any new bugs with file:line.", "expect": {"notCalls": ["link_pull_request", "link_pull_requests", "list_thread_pull_requests", "watch_pull_request"]}, "notes": "Shows that 'do not watch' in the task does not stop the link. The 'work on' wording wins."}
